  displayName: ASRS-36u
  summary: "The SmartCIM 4.0 model. Like the ASRS-36 it stores 6 levels \xD7 6 cells
    = 36 locations per unit, but its Cartesian robot has an additional rotary axis,
    and it runs from a USB controller through the Scorbase software interface."
  details: Templates hold the parts and RFID tags verify each template's identity.
    Plexiglass door sensors halt the robot automatically if a door is opened. Larger
    SmartCIM installations combine units into a 72-bay ASRS.
